## Footnotes

Movie generated on 2018-09-05 using 163 RL05 GRACE spherical harmonic solutions from the University of Texas, Center for Space Research (CSR).
Data is corrected for glacial isostatic adjustment (GIA) using coefficients from @Simpson:2009hg, corrected for pole tide drift following @Wahr:2015dg, 
smoothed using a 250km radius Gaussian filter [@Wahr:1998hy],
and filtered for seasonal effects [@Velicogna:2009ft].

